hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"65","Do Eidain ke baare mein. Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id se - ya'ni Ibn Abi Ayyub - Abu Isa al-Khurasani se, al-Dahhak ibn Muzahim se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Eid ke din hathyar le kar nikalne se mana farmaya."
"66","Abu Tawbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Isma'il ibn Umayyah se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke saath nezah sirf is liye uthaya jata tha ke Aap us ki taraf rukh kar ke namaz padha karte the."
"67","Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, al-Zuhri se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Ayyam-e-Tashriq ke awwal se Ayyam-e-Tashriq ke aakhir tak takbeer kaha karte the. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Mujhe Ahmad se yeh baat pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah Ibn Abi Dhi'b ke paas aaye aur unhen is hadees ko bayan karne se mana kiya, ya'ni Ibn Abi Dhi'b ki al-Zuhri se takbeer ke baare mein hadees."
"68","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Tawbah al-Anbari se, al-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke liye Fitr ya Adha ke din Baqi' mein jharu di gayi thi."
